OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FMark Forrest celebrates summer
OL,7,     Fmusic-making in the UK and beyond,
OL,8,     Fincluding highlights from Chineke!
OL,9,     FOrchestra's appearance at this
OL,10,     Fyear's BBC Proms.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Sally
OL,12,G     Beamish
OL,13,     F2/5. Donald Macleod and Sally
OL,14,     FBeamish delve into her student
OL,15,     Fyears, travels and early
OL,16,     Fprofessional career.
OL,17,G1700 In Tune
OL,18,     FKatie Derham is joined in the In
OL,19,     FTune studio by the Zoe Rahman
OL,20,     FTrio, who play tracks from their
OL,21,     Flatest album, 'Hull Suite', which
OL,22,     Fwas recently released.
